From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iwinfo: mtk: harden scanlist, assoclist, config lifetime, and
 security queries

Bound MTK scanlist/assoclist outputs, retain UCI config strings before context unload, zero-initialize freqlist entries, and validate security type ioctls.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
